    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR1c0001-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-3a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:30:15.345+09:00">Join, join, chirps the osprey</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-3a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:30:42.486+09:00">On the islet of the river.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-3a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:31:10.962+09:00">Slender and shy is the chaste girl,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-4a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:31:42.091+09:00">For Milord's son a loving mate.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-4a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:33:16.459+09:00">Up and down bobs the the floating Heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-4a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:33:37.429+09:00">To the left and the right drifting it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-4a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:34:49.873+09:00">Slender and shy is the chaste girl,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-4a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:35:32.037+09:00">Awake and asleep seeking her.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-4a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:35:47.54+09:00">Seeking her but not getting her,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-4a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:28:36.278+09:00">Awake and asleep wishing to pair,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-4a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:38:18.679+09:00">Longing oh, longing oh,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-4a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:38:33.858+09:00">Tossing and turning to and fro.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-5a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:42:05.276+09:00">Up and down bobs the Floating Heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-5a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:39:32.553+09:00">To the left and right picking it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-5a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:39:50.218+09:00">Slender and shy is the chaste girl,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-5a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:47:25.611+09:00">with harp and lute befriending her.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-7a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-24T16:40:44+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-5a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:42:23.811+09:00">Up and down bobs the Floating Heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-5a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:42:40.216+09:00">To the left and right picking it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-5a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:42:51.315+09:00">Slender and shy is the chaste girl</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-5a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:48:36.945+09:00">with bell and drum delighting her.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-8a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:54:56.538+09:00">The "Kudzu Spreads"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-8a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T16:55:31.001+09:00">concerns the basis of the queen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-8a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:07:47.556+09:00">When the queen is t her parents' home,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-8a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:08:06.319+09:00">her purpose resides in the affairs of women's work;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-8a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:08:31.79+09:00">If personally frugal and moderate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-8a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:08:50.659+09:00">wearing well-washed clothes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-8a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:51:50.756+09:00">and respectful of her teachers, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-8a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:52:14.023+09:00">then she can she can return to comfort her parents</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-8a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:53:01.423+09:00">and transform all under heaven through the Way of the wife.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-9a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:53:40.112+09:00">2  The spreading of the kuzu, oh!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-9a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:54:04.814+09:00">Stretching throughout all the valley,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-9a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:54:19.131+09:00">With its leaves in such profusion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-9a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:54:30.493+09:00">The yellow bird goes off in flight.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-9a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:54:57.843+09:00">And settles on the shrubby tree;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:55:15.057+09:00">Its calling is slit-slit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:55:26.773+09:00">The spreading of the kudzu, oh!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:55:38.537+09:00">stretching throughout all the valley.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:55:46.563+09:00">With its leaves shutting out the light.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:56:05.631+09:00">These are reaped and harvested.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:56:18.69+09:00">To make linen, both fine and coarse;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:56:36.304+09:00">Wear it, it will never wear out.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:56:49.763+09:00">Gong now to tell the teaching,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:57:02.326+09:00">Going to say: "I'm going home."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:57:10.266+09:00">Now washing my undergarments,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:57:19.149+09:00">Now laundering my cover blouse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-11a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:57:50.456+09:00">But whether they are clean or not,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_001-12a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-07-24T17:59:08.13+09:00">I'm going home to ease my parents.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_023-54a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-25T23:47:46.693+09:00">and then there were hundreds of sons!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_024-28a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-26T03:35:06.946+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_025-18a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-26T04:50:10.857+09:00">shàng kě mó yě.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR1c0001_tls_025-29a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-26T05:02:59.525+09:00">Beneath them it takes but ten days,</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
